PY  - 2018
DO  - 10.1145/3230543
KW  - hit
N1  - load: congestion*; D: data center*, data-center*
AB  - SIGCOMM 2018 combines excellence with inclusiveness. The schedule continues long SIGCOMM traditions and also innovates to diversify and strengthen the conference. The meeting is centered on a highly selective main-conference program consisting of 40 papers in network congestion control, routing, data center networking, IoT, wireless technologies, applications, hardware support, SDN, verification, and measurements.
